    "mode": "discrete_key_pose_review",
    "walk": "static idle fallback, no walk clip or authored walk animation",
    "basic_attack": "static idle fallback; no unrelated active pose",
    "scale": "One standing reference height per identity; per-pose scale from the manually reviewed lower-neck to pelvis axis, never normalize crouch/airborne height or canvas size. Approximate source landmarks remain subject to scene review.",
    "ground": "Grounded root uses reviewed two-foot contact midpoint. Airborne M02 uses pelvis ground projection plus the reference pelvis-to-floor distance; sole landmarks are never a ground root.",
